 explanation:"NetworkPolicies are firewall rules for pods. They select pods with labels and define ingress (incoming) and egress (outgoing) traffic rules. By default in OpenShift, pods can talk to any other pod in any namespace. NetworkPolicies restrict this. If no NetworkPolicy selects a pod, it allows all traffic.",
